# Six, investment arguments

# 6.1 Look at the logic (three cores)

**1. Core beneficiaries of AI infrastructure, with high degree of certainty of growth**
Andlefino is not an "AI Concept Unit," but an AI Foundation "Stealer". Q12026 orders $9.4 billion, Book-to-Bill 1.24. This is a real demand, not a forecast. Each generation of AI servers requires more and faster connections, and Afino, as a high-speed interconnected technical leader, is one of the most determined beneficiaries.

**2. Management executives are not in the right position**
The decentralized entrepreneurship management model of Afino is its unique competitive advantage. 130 stand-alone modules allow companies to be as flexible as start-ups, while enjoying the size advantages of large companies. The combination of "growth plus profit expansion" is rare, with a 52% increase in income in 2025, while raising the adjusted operating profit margin to 26.2%.

**3. Growth opportunities for PEG<1**
The forward PE is about 29 x, but the 2026 EPS is projected to increase by 40% +, and PEG is well below 1. For a high-quality growth unit with a wide-banded river, 36% + ROE, 26% + ROIC, this valuation is historically unusual.

# 6.2 Look at the empty logic (3 cores)

**1. Fundamental uncertainty about the continuity of the AI capital cycle**
History has repeatedly shown that investment in infrastructure is highly cyclical (optic bubbles, 4G investment cycles, cloud computing investment cycles). Current AI capital investment may be overheating.

**2. ComScope M & As significantly increased operational and financial risks**
The $10.5 billion in large mergers and acquisitions is unprecedented in the history of Anfino. Total liabilities of $18.7 billion have significantly reduced financial flexibility. If the AI cycle slows down before the merger is completed, companies will face double pressure to slow growth and leverage.

**3. Current PEs are still above the median historical**
34x PE is higher than the median of 10 years, 30x15%. If the 2027 increase returns to the median (which is a perfectly reasonable scenario), 30+PE will be difficult to maintain.

